# Lesson 25 `make run`: type a few commands into the shell.
emulation RunFor "0.05"
sysbus.usart2 WriteLine "help"
emulation RunFor "0.05"
sysbus.usart2 WriteLine "led red on"
emulation RunFor "0.05"
sysbus.usart2 WriteLine "baud 16000000 115200"
emulation RunFor "0.05"
sysbus.usart2 WriteLine "uptime"
emulation RunFor "0.05"
